<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Would You Fall in Love with Me Again?</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Twenty years... Adora has been gone for twenty years and there's been no word of what happened to her. The last time Catra saw her was when she left for war alongside most of Eternia. If it wasn't for Finn, she would have joined her and fight by her side during the war...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's been twenty years since Adora last stepped foot on Eternia. She left her home with 600 of her people under her command. She spent ten years at war and another ten desperately trying to return to her family. After years of fighting, years of loss, years of longing, she finally finds herself on the shores of her kingdom.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(Basically, an Ithaca Saga AU but with Adora and Catra! And Finn as Telemachus! TWs will be in the author's notes, so please be aware, it isn't anything that isn't said or implied in the actual musical though! Each chapter is based on a song in the Ithaca Saga, starting with "The Challenge" and ending with "Would You Fall in Love with Me". CH1 is in Catra's POV, CH2 is in Adora's POV, CH3 in Hordak's POV, and then CH4 and CH5 are in Adora's POV. Made it a series because I will eventually write and post a version of the last chapter but in Catra's POV instead of Adora's)&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>AuthorWithoutaName</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mature</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow/Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora &amp; Catra &amp; Finn | Adora/Catra Child (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora &amp; Light Hope (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Finn | Adora/Catra Child (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Horde Prime (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Horde Prime Clones (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Light Hope (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Inspired by EPIC: The Musical - Jorge Rivera-Herrans</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Specifically the Ithaca Saga</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Implied/Referenced Rape/Non-con</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>nothing happens though</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>It is discussed and it is in CH2 and CH3 only</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Each Chapter is Based on a Song in the Album</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angst with a Happy Ending</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Blood and Violence</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora is Odyesseus</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra is Penelope</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Finn is Telemachus</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Prime is Antinous</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>The Clones are the Rest of the Suitors</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Graphic Depictions Of Violence</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Beheading in CH3</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Lots of violence and blood in CH3</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>unreliable narrators</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Pural because there's like three different narrators</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Implied Sexual Content</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Reunions</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora Needs a Hug (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Bag>
